      "key": [
        "Nameless Bloodstained Monument",
        "Kipumaki Cliff",
        "Homesick Lone Wolf"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Roland: Final comrades at Ashveil Peak",
      "content": "Varka's world quest (Ashveil Peak, Nod-Krai) shows Roland's last scene: knights who followed him from Mondstadt to Nod-Krai refuse to let him walk alone, and die fighting monsters. He seals their resting place and leaves a pale-furred wolf to guard it. It became the Radiant Glacial Wolf known as the Homesick Lone Wolf. Varka takes their swords and the Durandarte weapon appearance.",
