    "4": {
      "uid": 4,
      "key": [
        "Roland's imitation",
        "Wild Hunt",
        "Lonely Warrior"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Roland",
        "Varka",
        "Boreas"
      ],
      "comment": "Roland: The Abyssal imitation",
      "content": "After Rerir was expelled, the Abyss made an imitation of Roland to lead the Wild Hunt and infested Andrius's remains. It speaks of rectifying the world in the name of the Bloodstained Knight and keeps a frozen heart and mind from Roland's peak. In Lonely Warrior, Varka lets it assimilate his soul along with Boreas's, which the imitation had taken as a decoy; the thoughts of friends in Mondstadt then pull him out, and the imitation dissolves. It tells him no words can make a knight doubt his convictions.",
